<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Sick of Myself</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">5 Seconds of Summer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYONE'S A STAR! (Fully Evolved)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6AXh6IRCj8c2oKkWXY1MDQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.562" end="00:17.730">I'm so sick of my, sick of myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.730" end="00:20.978">Wish I was, wish I was somebody else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.978" end="00:24.162">Waking up next to you, best that I've felt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.162" end="00:27.346">Nothing else, nothing else, nothing else helps</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.346" end="00:30.595">I'm so goddamn sick of myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.595" end="00:33.746">Wish I could walk a mile not in my shoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.746" end="00:37.343">Of a man, of a man, I was a shell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.343" end="00:40.136">Till there was you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.136" end="00:41.636" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.186" end="00:43.367">Everything's Monday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.367" end="00:46.247">Clock just goes one way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.247" end="00:52.951">I can't look myself in the eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.951" end="00:59.232">Where are you sleeping tonight?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.232" end="01:00.732" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.467" end="01:02.600">I'm so sick of my, sick of myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.600" end="01:05.716">Wish I was, wish I was somebody else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.716" end="01:08.951">Waking up next to you, best that I've felt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.951" end="01:12.100">Nothing else, nothing else, nothing else helps</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.100" end="01:15.407">I'm so goddamn sick of myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.407" end="01:18.591">Wish I could walk a mile not in my shoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.591" end="01:22.109">Of a man, of a man, I was a shell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.109" end="01:25.038">Till there was you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.038" end="01:27.019" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.019" end="01:30.017">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.017" end="01:33.247">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.247" end="01:34.813">Yeah, yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.813" end="01:37.396" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.396" end="01:40.995">I'm drifting out of touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.995" end="01:43.960">Miss who I once was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.960" end="01:50.261">I can't look myself in the eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.261" end="01:57.108">I need you, I need you tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.108" end="01:58.608" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.639" end="02:00.722">Please stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.722" end="02:04.022">Please stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.022" end="02:07.204">Please stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.204" end="02:10.306">Please stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.306" end="02:13.613">Please stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.613" end="02:16.856">Please stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.856" end="02:19.920">Please stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.920" end="02:23.920">Please stay</p></div></body></tt>